  era: "c. 1000\u2013600 BCE \xB7 Section 3 \xB7 Vedic Period \xB7 c. 1500 \u2013 600 BCE"
  title: Later Vedic Period
  text: The Later Vedic period, about 1000 to 600 BCE, is known from the later Vedas, the Brahmanas and the Upanishads. Settlement moved east into the Ganga plain, and society became more agricultural, hierarchical and focused on ritual.
